# The lessons' house style (AGENTS.md, "Lesson conventions"): 4-space indents,
# Allman braces, right-hand pointer stars and aligned trailing comments.
# `make format` applies it to the lesson sources; `make check-format` (CI)
# fails if a lesson differs. CI pins clang-format 23 from PyPI, since other
# major versions can format a few constructs differently.
#
# ColumnLimit 0 keeps the lessons' own line breaks, and ReflowComments false
# leaves the long explanatory comments exactly as written: the comments are
# the lesson.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
ColumnLimit: 0
AlignTrailingComments: true
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Never
IndentCaseLabels: false
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: Never
ReflowComments: false
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
